<title>BELARUS: Belarus rouble edged down to 15,050 in Minsk.</title>
<headline>Belarus rouble edged down to 15,050 in Minsk.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian rouble edged down to 15,050 per dollar on the Minsk Interbank Currency Exchange from 15,000 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    November 4	    November 1</p>
<p> Rate to dollar		    15,050		  15,000</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $1.156 million	    $2.797 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
